[{"id":3424032782,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MFpgO","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?u=24618295fece29a0bf5c850faf2555985232f5f2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","login":"aaronfranke","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112224#pullrequestreview-3424032782","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112224","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-05T19:49:46Z"},{"id":3424606731,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MH1oL","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"This makes sense to me. Sounds like a good first step to reduce `Variant` implicit conversions!\r\n\r\nThe only concern I have is that a lot of these conversions/comparisons are making allocations. Mainly, I'm talking about all the string literal comparisons.\r\nThis PR doesn't change this - the comparisons are already unnecessarily making conversions. But it would be \"setting it in stone\", not to be optimized later. And we would have no better alternative for anyone who wants to avoid this.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if there is a good solution to that. \r\nIn my own code, I might use something like `variant.get_type() == Variant::STRING && String(variant) == \"literal\"`, but this is probably too verbose/unexpected for our own codebase.\r\n\r\nThe only thing I can think of would be to have an `operator==(const char *)` (implemented with the above check). Then, we wouldn't have to cast `\"literal\"` to `(Variant)`.\r\nOn the plus side, this would really optimize the PR, and give it a bit of a performance boost too.\r\nOn the negative side, this would make a \"special case\" for `String` `Variant` handling, which we may not want to add.\r\n\r\nI think all in all, I'd be in favour of making that addition. But I'd be interested to hear your thoughts.\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112224#pullrequestreview-3424606731","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112224","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-05T22:10:23Z"},{"id":3424994253,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MJUPN","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112224#pullrequestreview-3424994253","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112224","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-05T23:48:33Z"},{"id":3425032790,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7MJdpW","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e